      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("At last, friends, we have almost reached the Lintanir Forest, the home of the North Elves. I was born not far east of here...more years ago than I care to remember."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("After being in this wilderness for so long, it will be good to get some rest!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("But there is a great fog around us again! We don’t know what dangers may lie ahead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("So long as we move ahead with caution and prudence, I am sure we will reach the safety and hospitality of the elves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "horse-canter.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Telerandor",
            type: "Elvish Rider",
            side: 1,
            x: 6,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Telerandor",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Telerandor",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Telerandor",
            text: _("My lords! I have found you at last."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Greetings, Telerandor, herald of Lintanir! Why have you been searching for us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Telerandor",
            text: _("When my lord learned of your coming, he sent riders out looking for you! There is trouble afoot!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Trouble? What kind of trouble?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Telerandor",
            text: _("We have sighted a great host to the south, a host of the men of Wesnoth. And we believe they are looking for you! There is not a moment to lose. You must make haste, east to Lintanir. Only there will you be safe!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I only hope we can avoid them. We will have to bear north-east."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Telerandor",
            text: _("That is not all, my lord. The foul orcs have heard of the coming of these men, and are even now gathering a great host to oppose them to the north! It is now certain that there will be a great battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("This sounds very dangerous. Perhaps we should retreat to the West, and hide until the battle is over?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("I think these wild lands are too dangerous for that! Anyhow... I expected you to be on the side of Wesnoth, Li’sar?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("I am an honorable princess, not an impostor like you! I promised that I would be on your side until we made it out of these lands, and I will keep my promise!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Telerandor",
            text: _("Sir, madam, there is no time to lose! You must make it east, to the home of my people. Only there will you be safe!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Rider, do not fool with us. You yourself say men and orcs wage war on this plain that lies ahead. Do you propose we fly to the great woods of the east?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Telerandor",
            text: _("My lord, you must rush across the field before the main host of each army makes it to the battle. It is the only way to avoid this great calamity."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("I feared you would say that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Come then, Konrad, let us go. We will do what must be done."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Telerandor",
            text: _("My lord has begun assembling a party of elves to come and escort you into the forest. Beware, for we are all in great danger!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("Konrad, the encampment must be torn down. Any delay and these armies will crush us. Any evidence of our passage through here, and they will chase us."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Re",
            cells: "3-5,18-19;3,16",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("So, Konrad, do you think we can simply trot across the battlefield?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Stop for a moment, Li’sar. Look — you can barely see them in the distance there, but the advance scouts have found each other. The Queen’s troops are marching full speed for the orcs’ camp, and vice-versa. These armies are out for blood."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("But they will not neglect to notice our presence in their midst! We are walking into slaughter!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("(hushed) Our soldiers will defend us as we rush across the field. Sorry to be blunt, but you and I are the only ones who need to make it across alive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("...and Delfador, of course. And Kalenz... and.."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Ach! I understand, Konrad. I am no stranger to the burden of command. Onward!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "konrad_store",
            kill: "no",
            id: "Konrad",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "temp_x",
            value: "$konrad_store.x",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "temp_y",
            value: "$konrad_store.y",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thalindil",
            text: _("(exhausted) We have... (pant) finally found you!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
